{
  "info": {
    "name": "Egoola API \u2014 Accounts & Auth",
    "_postman_id": "6f1e6a6a-2b3d-4f6a-9c9a-egoola-accounts-auth",
    "description": "Covers what's built so far: Admin/Seller/Buyer login (JWT) + token refresh, and Admin-only Admin/Seller/Buyer management.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Pick the `Egoola - Local` environment (or edit `base_url`).\n2. Run any request in **Auth** first \u2014 its \"Tests\" script saves the returned `access`/`refresh` tokens into collection variables automatically.\n3. Every request under **Accounts** already sends `Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}` \u2014 no manual copy-pasting needed.\n4. When a 401 says the token expired, run **Auth > Refresh Token** \u2014 it re-saves `access_token` the same way.\n\nAll accounts endpoints require an Admin token (401 = no/invalid token, 403 = valid token but wrong role \u2014 see docs/authentication.md in the repo).\n\nFor Country/State/City/Thana reference-data management, see the separate Egoola API \u2014 Geography collection. For the full Seller Verification workflow (verify/reject with a mandatory note, verification_logs history) and deeper Seller-only coverage (business info, media upload), see the separate Egoola API \u2014 Seller collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
