            },
            "description": "Public endpoint. A seller logs in with **phone number + password** (admins and buyers use email). Returns a token carrying actor_type=seller \u2014 will get 403 on every Accounts endpoint below (those are Admin-only), which is expected until Seller self-service routes exist."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
